file tools/c/convergence_census.sh the proven predicate drops the tool from its own sibling set and reads a non-comment line; header records the fault and what is still owed
file tools/c/convergence_census_witness.rish four asserts on the new legs, including the elder numerator admitting self-certification
file tools/fixtures/c/convergence_census_control.sh four planted legs proving the numerator repair from both sides on a real repository
