scope one guard's numerator repaired, its control widened, its roster row corrected, and one QA frame worked down
status GREEN -- convergence_census, convergence_prove, ascii_comment, shell_dialect, spoken_ascii, both living-pin guards run on metal. The cold pass's three reds -- reds_pin_capacity, stash_record, standing_equipment -- stood before this lap and none is mine.
recommend keep-going -- the pen-tree prover is the next real instrument in this family, and it is bounded: copy a repository, run a flag-driven operator twice, diff.
